        "attribution": "Mézard and Zecchina were central to the method's application to hard constraint problems; Montanari helped develop and extend its mathematical and algorithmic foundations.",
        "maturity": "The ideas have been influential for decades and have been tested against rigorous results and practical inference problems.",
